      "message": "USBLL: Show data field for Zero Length Packets\n\nShow \"Data: <none>\" for Zero Length Packets. Displaying the zero-sized\nbyte array allow easy filtering for ZLPs.\n\nThe primary motivation for this change was to make filters like\n  len(usbll.data) != 192 && usbll.dst contains \".8\"\ninclude ZLPs in the filtered packets list.\n",
